{
  "title": "Quick Citrusy Korean Tofu Skillet",
  "description": "A light and citrusy Korean dish featuring ground cinnamon and shio-cure, perfect for a weeknight dinner. This satvik-friendly recipe is made in an iron-teppan vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Korean",
  "diet": [
    "satvik",
